1.0.2 2026-10-16
  - Text files are now plain git files instead of git-annex pointers: 4692 files
    (.tsv 2401, .json 2290, .gitignore 1). Their content is unchanged: each file's SHA-256 equals its
    former annex key. Catalogues such as EEGDash read sidecars from the git tree
    without downloading annexed content, so they could not read sampling rate,
    channel count or duration for this dataset.
  - Added .gitattributes so text files stay in git from now on.
  - No data file changed: every annexed recording keeps its annex key.

